Package: omicidxr
Title: Access the OmicIDX omicx metadata database
Version: 0.0.0.9005
Date: 2026-01-17
Authors@R: 
    person(given = "Sean",
           family = "Davis",
           email = "seandavi@gmail.com",
           role = c("aut", "cre"))
Description: The omicidxr package provides an interface to 
    the OmicIDX omicx metadata database.
    It allows users to query and retrieve metadata
    about various omics datasets stored in the OmicIDX database.
    The package leverages DuckDB for efficient data storage 
    and retrieval, and provides a user-friendly API for 
    accessing the data.
